<title>POLAND: Polfa Kutno Q1 net rises to PLN 5.9.</title>
<headline>Polfa Kutno Q1 net rises to PLN 5.9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polfa Kutno SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     8.20   vs    7.87</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 7.95   vs    7.18</p>
<p>    net profit			     5.85   vs    4.81</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Polfa Kutno SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     51.28   vs   45.80</p>
<p>    costs of sales			32.35   vs   30.33</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.09   vs    2.36</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.15   vs    0.40</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.41   vs    1.08</p>
<p>    investment			     5.45   vs    1.37</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
